1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,330
What is the reading about?

2
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:15,550
The reading is about the new school.

3
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:21,000
These are students.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,880
This is the new school.

5
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:38,110
You have read, tell: Where is the new school built?

6
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:51,330
The new school is built on old school site.

7
00:00:52,880 --> 00:01:00,770
What does the reading describe about the school.

8
00:01:06,110 --> 00:01:17,110
The reading describes: yellow wall panels, red tiles shining among trees.

9
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:27,660
In classroom: white lime walls, blue doors, rosewood tables.

10
00:01:28,110 --> 00:01:35,220
All shine and smell fragrant in autumn sunlight.

11
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:44,110
Find sentence expressing student's feeling.

12
00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:53,440
A. My new school is built on old school site.

13
00:01:56,880 --> 00:02:05,770
B. I step into classroom, both surprised and familiar.

14
00:02:07,110 --> 00:02:14,770
C. All shine and smell fragrant in autumn sunlight.

15
00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:35,440
The sentence expressing student's feeling when stepping into classroom at new school is sentence B.

16
00:02:36,220 --> 00:02:43,110
I step into classroom, both surprised and familiar.

17
00:02:43,660 --> 00:02:51,440
Student's feeling when stepping into classroom is what?

18
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:04,440
Two feelings are surprised and familiar.

19
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:10,030
After practicing reading and learning lesson,

20
00:03:10,030 --> 00:03:13,400
we can see lesson content is:

21
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:18,860
Expressing love and pride of students with new school.

